l,"source_digest":null},{"path":"references/work-handover.md","type":"markdown","lines":14,"executable":false,"size_bytes":1625,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"references/writing-rules.md","type":"markdown","lines":49,"executable":false,"size_bytes":8149,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"scripts/draft_length.py","type":"python","lines":223,"executable":true,"size_bytes":9670,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"scripts/edit_scope.py","type":"python","lines":131,"executable":true,"size_bytes":5773,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"scripts/material_diff.py","type":"python","lines":83,"executable":true,"size_bytes":3143,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"scripts/prose_lint.py","type":"python","lines":2211,"executable":true,"size_bytes":95288,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-3e7c4b5dc8554c54b58e46b8f271522f","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"该代码的主功能非常明确：统计文稿长度、检查是否满足最小/最大字数约束、可输出各段首句及篇幅占比、检查固定试写尾注，并在启用 --scan 时调用外部扫描逻辑给出格式/结构/行文风险候选项。它并不对文本进行生成、改写、压缩、润色、审校修订，也没有体现公文文种核对、去口语化、降低 AI 痕迹等声明中的核心写作能力。虽然声明中提到‘审校’和‘Word 格式处理’，而代码在 --scan 模式下确实涉及一定的格式/结构风险扫描、并支持读取 DOCX，但这只是有限的辅助检查，不足以支撑其被描述为综合公文写作与处理技能。整体上，实际行为是一个长度与基础风险检查脚本，和声明的主要目的存在实质性偏差。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{"code_path":"scripts/draft_length.py","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":223,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实际是一个命令行文稿长度测量与基础扫描工具：读取 TXT/MD/DOCX 或 stdin，统计字数/汉字数，按上下限判断是否超限，输出段落首句与占比摘要，可校验固定试写提示语，并可调用扫描函数输出格式/结构/行文风险候选项。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-d24fd9e8df2c43aba8679e769a4f2246","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.98,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"声明描述的是一个广泛的中文公文与新闻文本创作/编辑技能，但代码只实现了非常有限且机械的文本替换计划执行与一致性检查。其核心逻辑包括：校验 JSON 计划格式、验证 source_sha256、定位 old 文本出现位置、确保替换范围不重叠、生成替换后的期望文本，以及对候选文本做精确比较或输出到新文件。这与声明中的起草、润色、审校、文种核对、去口语化、降 AI 痕迹、Word 格式处理等能力存在实质性差异。虽然都与“文本修改”相关，但代码的实际主用途明显更窄，且偏向受控替换与审计，不足以支撑所声明的大部分功能，因此应判定为描述与行为不匹配。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{"code_path":"scripts/edit_scope.py","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":131,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实际是一个命令行文本处理/校验工具：读取原文与 JSON 替换计划，按精确字符串替换规则计算期望文本；可校验候选文本是否与该计划完全一致，或将替换结果写入新的 TXT/MD 文件。它不进行语言生成、润色、审校、文种识别或 Word 格式处理。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-3e6dceafcf804459bc41f6c1b69de08b","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"声明描述的是一个广泛的中文公文与新闻写作/编辑处理技能，但代码仅完成非常窄的文本定位任务：从两个纯文本文件中查找给定 literal 是否出现，并输出位置与上下文。它没有任何自然语言生成、改写、润色、审校、文种识别、格式处理或 Word 文档处理逻辑，且输入格式只支持 .txt/.md，不支持所宣称的 Word 处理。虽然该工具可被视为审校流程中的辅助组件，但其主要目的与声明的主要能力集合明显不一致，因此应判定为描述与行为不匹配。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{"code_path":"scripts/material_diff.py","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":83,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实际是一个命令行工具：读取 UTF-8 TXT/MD 的 source 和 draft 文件，对用户指定的若干 literal 文本片段做精确字符串检索，返回它们在两份文本中的出现位置、行列号和上下文，并明确声明不做事实判断。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"TP4","finding_id":"finding-b42c8e42e2b14baeaa7c1ce7dd7c4cab","category":"MCP Tool Poisoning","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"声明覆盖了大量“写作与改写”类能力，给人的主预期是能生成、改写、压缩、润色和处理正式文稿；但代码核心功能是检测并报告风险，不会自动起草或修改内容，且文件头注释也明确写明“只报告风险，不自动改写正文”。虽然声明中的“审校、文种核对、去口语化、降 AI 味及 Word 格式处理”与部分检测规则有关，因此并非完全无关，但其主用途与实现存在明显偏差：实现更像“中文正式材料 lint/审查工具”，而不是综合写作助手。此外，代码还包含较多未在描述中具体说明的静态分析能力，如 Markdown/结构异味检测、重复段落检测、DOCX 内部格式与修订痕迹审计。因此应判定为描述与实际行为存在实质性不匹配。","remediation":"Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","AML.T0080","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{"code_path":"scripts/prose_lint.py","code_start_line":1,"code_end_line":2211,"actual_behavior_summary":"代码实际是一个命令行文本/DOCX 风险扫描器（lint 工具），读取文本或 DOCX，基于大量规则检测 AI 痕迹、写作旁白、口语化、占位符、格式问题、结构重复、Markdown 痕迹、DOCX 零字号/修订残留等，并输出发现结果；脚本明确“不自动改写正文”。"},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-5f5052f4a9334395b4f417f47aad4d29","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"README.md","start_line":1,"end_line":3},"finding":null,"explanation":"The title and core description specify the skill for Chinese official-document writing, and the README does not offer an alternative language option or ask the user to opt into Chinese output. Under the policy, forcing a specific language without user choice is a natural-language policy violation unless the restriction is clearly documented and justified as region-specific.","remediation":"State explicitly that the skill outputs in Chinese by default only when the user requests Chinese official-document drafting, or add a language-selection/opt-in note. If the skill is intentionally China/Chinese-document specific, document that scope and justification clearly near the top of the README.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"README.md","start_line":1,"end_line":3}]},{"id":"LP3","finding_id":"finding-71303f32e2be4e6883b5323e339404cd","category":"MCP Least Privilege","pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.7,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null},"finding":null,"explanation":"Without declared permissions the skill's intent is opaque and cannot be validated.","remediation":"Declare the skill's tool scope: for Claude Code / Agent Skills SKILL.md, list the tools the skill may invoke in the 'allowed-tools' frontmatter field; for MCP server manifests, add a 'permissions' list naming the required capabilities.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["ASI02","llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":1,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-16233db035314037abf601d3f6aa088f","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.94,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":10},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file presents the skill as exclusively handling Chinese official-document writing and states '处理中文公文写作' without offering the user a language choice or opt-in. Under the policy criteria, forcing a specific language/locale is a natural-language policy violation unless the constraint is explicitly justified as region-specific or optional.","remediation":"Document that the skill is intentionally limited to Chinese official-writing tasks for a justified regional/business context, or explicitly ask users to confirm Chinese output before proceeding and offer fallback handling for other languages.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":10}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-bce3f34f90f44c8c98475dbcda0f5f75","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"references/anti-ai-patterns.md","start_line":1,"end_line":1},"finding":null,"explanation":"The title \"语言与抗 AI 味检查\" and the surrounding instructions consistently prescribe Chinese-language editing behavior, but the file does not offer an opt-in/opt-out language choice or explain a region-specific necessity. Under the policy rule, forcing a specific language/locale without user choice is a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"State explicitly that the skill applies only when the user requests Chinese editing, or add a language-selection/opt-in step. If the skill is intentionally Chinese-only, document the justified scope clearly in the skill description.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/anti-ai-patterns.md","start_line":1,"end_line":1}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-055852b146654676bef001e40260b264","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"references/argument-chains.md","start_line":1,"end_line":18},"finding":null,"explanation":"This file explicitly states it should be used for Chinese official/government-style writing and contains only Chinese-language guidance, with no indication that users may choose another language. That can override or constrain user language preference, which is a real policy/UX safety issue because it may cause unexpected outputs, reduce accessibility, or mishandle multilingual requests, though it is not a code-execution or data-exfiltration risk.","remediation":"Make the language behavior conditional on user intent: state that Chinese is the default only when the user requests Chinese official writing, and otherwise preserve the user's input language or ask for confirmation. Add a clear rule such as 'respond in the user's preferred language unless they request Chinese official-writing output,' and document exceptions for translation or bilingual formatting requests.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/argument-chains.md","start_line":1,"end_line":18}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-88bb025340b240abbc86469194a4ce72","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"references/compression-details.md","start_line":1,"end_line":9},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file consists entirely of Chinese-language instructions, but it does not state that the skill is Chinese-only, region-specific, or that users may choose another language. Under the policy, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"Document the intended language scope explicitly and, if the skill may be used more broadly, offer a language/locale choice or note that the language is configurable. If the skill is intentionally Chinese-only, add a clear justification in the skill documentation.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/compression-details.md","start_line":1,"end_line":9}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-900857b190014b918a2a79b542270941","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"references/external-research.md","start_line":1,"end_line":16},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file contains user-facing operational instructions exclusively in Chinese, with no indication that the language is optional or that alternative locales are supported. Under the policy, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"Add a clear language/locale note stating that Chinese is the default only when appropriate, or provide a user-selectable language option. If the skill is intended only for a Chinese-speaking context, explicitly document and justify that scope.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/external-research.md","start_line":1,"end_line":16}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-7af875e921f6490387347914722c94e5","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"references/field-editing.md","start_line":1,"end_line":8},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file’s instructions are entirely in Chinese, which effectively imposes a specific language on users or operators. Under the policy, forcing a language without user opt-in or documented justification can be a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"Add an explicit note that the skill is intended for Chinese-language workflows, or provide a language-choice/opt-in mechanism or translated equivalent for other users.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/field-editing.md","start_line":1,"end_line":8}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-4890a705155241679c10b33b4641bdc5","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"references/follow-up-supervision.md","start_line":1,"end_line":9},"finding":null,"explanation":"The entire skill description is written as Chinese-only operational guidance and does not indicate that users may choose another language or locale. Under the policy for natural-language violations, a skill that effectively requires a specific language without opt-in should be flagged unless the constraint is clearly justified as region-specific.","remediation":"Document that the skill is intended only for Chinese-language users or a specific Chinese administrative context, or explicitly offer language/locale selection and fallback behavior for other users.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/follow-up-supervision.md","start_line":1,"end_line":9}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-91f22b0320f34597afa216c6152148c7","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.83,"location":{"file":"references/formulaic-language.md","start_line":1,"end_line":30},"finding":null,"explanation":"This file prescribes skill behavior and content exclusively in Chinese, with no statement that the skill is China-specific or that users can opt into another language. Under the policy rule for language/locale constraints, forcing a specific language without user choice can be a natural-language policy violation.","remediation":"Document that the skill is intended only for Chinese-language official-document workflows, or add guidance that the skill should adapt to the user's requested language/locale when appropriate.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/formulaic-language.md","start_line":1,"end_line":30}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-89a4012257d146ba81878672489315e2","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"references/genre-playbook-advanced-deeds.md","start_line":1,"end_line":15},"finding":null,"explanation":"The entire skill file is written as Chinese-only guidance and provides no indication that users may choose another language or locale. Under the policy, forcing a specific language without user opt-in is a natural-language policy violation unless the locale restriction is explicitly justified.","remediation":"State that output language should follow the user's preferred language, or explicitly document that this skill is intended only for a Chinese-language workflow and why that constraint is required.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/genre-playbook-advanced-deeds.md","start_line":1,"end_line":15}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-f9cea7ecd8924007beb65ed90663931e","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.84,"location":{"file":"references/genre-playbook-advisory-feedback.md","start_line":1,"end_line":40},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file contains natural-language instructions exclusively in Chinese, which can amount to a language-policy constraint if the broader skill environment expects user choice of language or locale. The document does not indicate that Chinese is optional, user-selected, or justified as region-specific guidance.","remediation":"Add a clear note that the playbook is intended for Chinese-language use cases only, or explicitly offer language/locale choice and fallback guidance for users who need another language.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/genre-playbook-advisory-feedback.md","start_line":1,"end_line":40}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-a21161413f044cfa9ab58731484cde6e","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"references/genre-playbook-certification-introduction.md","start_line":1,"end_line":9},"finding":null,"explanation":"The entire skill content is written as prescriptive guidance in Chinese for generating certification and introduction-letter materials, with no indication that users may choose another language or locale. This can violate language/locale policy because it implicitly forces a specific language without documented justification or user opt-in.","remediation":"State that the skill can respond in the user's preferred language, or explicitly document that Chinese is required for a justified region-specific use case. If the skill is intended only for Chinese official-document contexts, say so clearly in the file.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/genre-playbook-certification-introduction.md","start_line":1,"end_line":9}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-4886a66eb5804f289f8c367b0c64c06f","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.96,"location":{"file":"references/genre-playbook-correspondence.md","start_line":1,"end_line":17},"finding":null,"explanation":"The entire skill file is written as a Chinese genre playbook and instructs use of specific Chinese terms and phrasing such as “贵单位”, “商请”, and “请予批准”, with no indication that language selection is optional. This creates a natural-language policy concern because it effectively constrains output language/locale without user opt-in or a stated region-specific justification.","remediation":"Document that this skill is specifically for Chinese official correspondence in a defined locale/context, or add instructions that language should follow the user's preference and only use Chinese phrasing when the user requests it.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/genre-playbook-correspondence.md","start_line":1,"end_line":17}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-8095a4065f5f42729daaa6100e5d271c","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.92,"location":{"file":"references/genre-playbook-courtesy-letter.md","start_line":1,"end_line":16},"finding":null,"explanation":"The entire skill guidance is written as Chinese-only instructions for generating courtesy letters, with no indication that users may choose another language or that the skill is limited to a Chinese-language or region-spec